  "releaseNotes": "- **Added `IX` for Item Exchange**, including item and set searches, baskets, downloads, icons, and images\n- Added TMX video searches and metadata requests for search orders, tags, tag descriptions, track types, and vehicles\n- Fixed generated video field selections requesting fields unavailable on the selected TMX or MX site\n- Made JSON converters public so external serializers preserve Exchange integer and time formats\n- Updated the User-Agent to report the installed package version\n- Added .NET 11 support",
